          {
            "name": "search_restaurants",
            "title": "Search TableLink restaurants",
            "description": "Find restaurants that accept reservations through TableLink. Matches on restaurant name or cuisine, optionally narrowed by city. Returns name, city, region, cuisine, timezone, a booking URL, and a tenantId you pass to get_availability. Pass an empty query with a city to list that city.",
